{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8086bcca385c1cf4add78d22008d9b6815c335145694e903135f8f04eb07e391", "ja": "（今日は仕事で、野生のうさぎと触れ合える島に\n行ってきた。楽しい時間を過ごし、奈緒も上機嫌だ）", "zh": "（今天因为工作，去了一个可以和野生兔子亲密接触的岛。度过了一段愉快的时光，奈绪也心情大好）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "c885b8fcd8479ccd2c17b10d35054cb91f83e095724e0b4bd5175c38ec6483ac", "ja": "島のうさちゃんたち、ほんま可愛かったですね～。\nめっちゃ人懐っこくて、私も癒されました。", "zh": "岛上的小兔子们，真的好可爱啊～\n特别亲人，我也被好好治愈了一番呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "f6e770cc5a8b1b88830c0db0bd936bd0f18c79d6ef6a42f69914d75824e2dfa2", "ja": "それにみんな、自由に走り回って、\nのんびり過ごして……ちょっと羨ましいなーなんて。", "zh": "而且它们还自由自在地到处跑，悠闲地生活着……说实话，真让我有点羡慕呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9e62e8beb7f5457c16bb975255fd311ef98035ec4dcfd53942970e7bf2c59172", "ja": "うん、本当にいい場所だったよな。\nけど……羨ましい？", "zh": "嗯，那里真的是个很棒的地方啊。\n不过……羡慕？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "470ef9fc0663fa50b39e0ca3303e2a8991560ff06af90281c543c4705d1e4642", "ja": "だって、楽しそうやないですか？\n仲間と一緒に美味しいご飯食べて、お昼寝して……。", "zh": "因为看起来不是很开心吗？\n和伙伴们一起吃美味的饭，再睡个午觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "5f52af40066d7939c6c4cadd7f39b411bba2f2e6d020b494fe41a6603179d8b2", "ja": "遊びにきた人間たちに「かわいい！」って\n可愛がってもらえて……。", "zh": "被来玩的人类夸“好可爱！”，还被他们宠爱着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "8fbc8fb0295ab0a6dab23e7b18033fdb3a083bfdc428e7dfd7097adebfb7ee42", "ja": "あれ？　よう考えたら、今の私とおんなじですね？", "zh": "咦？仔细想想，和现在的我一模一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8ed194bb7917a7c57025806a892f9ccfca57796326629439ecbf079abafb2ccd", "ja": "同じって……？", "zh": "一样是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "f9beb6b776702b7cdb8c40668b1a7e881a779999626a1714315d08d313c04c6e", "ja": "私も劇場のみんなと楽しく過ごしてますし、ファンの\nみんなに「カワイイ」って褒めてもらってて……ほら！", "zh": "我也和剧场的大家一起开心地度过每一天，还经常被粉丝们夸“可爱”……你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8646c98131f1004342f7c7433ee5f54e63796feb7a667f01d0218d0242625aca", "ja": "言われてみれば……\n確かに、近いところがあるな。", "zh": "你这么一说……确实，有几分相似。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "e9756de1e5d11a10ca66216d5fc0a537144ff68c28a6469ab9a3e6cbea2c0305", "ja": "せやろ～！　って、そこはツッコんでください！\n「自分でカワイイとか、なんでやねん！」って。", "zh": "是吧～！……不对，请吐槽这里啊！\n“自己说自己可爱，这是闹哪样啊！”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d407395e5aeee88fff671a4f2f958b98981ab4b5cd54e66ce9c42811a64c9c4", "ja": "そうやって、素直に受け入れられると\n私が一番恥ずかしいやないですか～！", "zh": "你这样坦率地接受了，\n最害羞的反而是我呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7ca64151b47abf0d478126ac399affff5adae89da448efbaef3e90354c183ba4", "ja": "あ、今のボケだったのか……。\n奈緒が可愛いのは本当だし、全然気づかなかったよ。", "zh": "啊，原来刚才是在吐槽啊……  \n奈绪很可爱本来就是事实，我完全没察觉到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "59898e7ce5b895d23bd07f76ed198810e8c5448e8473bff775f5ec8135a50cf3", "ja": "！！　そんなストレートに言われると……！\nアカン、心の準備してへんかった……ううっ。", "zh": "！！被这么直白地说出来……！不行，我完全没做好心理准备……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1014_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0633_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "0ec954fed4b7b6e409f895270354fe9c5c41f6915985a410f7b677982f6006c2", "ja": "……なんでもないですっ！　それよりほら、\nもうすぐ到着みたいですよ！　降りる準備しましょ！", "zh": "……没什么啦！比起这个，你看，\n好像马上就要到了！我们准备下车吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
